             rbi_nullplan              
---------------------------------------
 Bitmap Heap Scan on rbi_null
   Recheck Cond: (t IS NULL)
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on rbi_null_t
         Index Cond: (t IS NULL)
(4 rows)

